---
title: "initialize (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate_params: validate tokenPrice, timing, addresses, fees
    q_validate_params --> q_check_timing: params valid
    q_validate_params --> q_revert_invalid: invalid params
    q_check_timing --> q_check_fees: prefundStartTime < prefundEndTime < startTime < endTime < refundEndTime
    q_check_timing --> q_revert_invalid: timing constraint violated
    q_check_fees --> q_set_state: fee basis points valid
    q_check_fees --> q_revert_invalid: invalid fees
    q_set_state --> q_store_config: store tokenPrice, bidToken, askToken, projectAdmin
    q_store_config --> q_store_timing: store prefundStartTime, prefundEndTime, startTime, endTime, refundEndTime
    q_store_timing --> q_store_fees: store legionFee, referrerFee bps values
    q_store_fees --> [*]: emit Initialized event
    q_revert_invalid --> [*]: revert InvalidInitializationParams

    note right of q_validate_params
        INV-001: tokenPrice must be greater than zero
        INV-002: minimumInvestAmount must be greater than zero
        INV-003: bidToken and askToken must be non-zero addresses
        INV-004: projectAdmin must be non-zero address
    end note

    note right of q_check_timing
        INV-005: prefundStartTime < prefundEndTime
        INV-006: prefundEndTime <= startTime
        INV-007: startTime < endTime
        INV-008: endTime < refundEndTime
        INV-009: prefund duration between 1 hour and 12 weeks
        INV-010: refund period between 1 hour and 2 weeks
    end note
